  <ScenTitle>Ground Pounder, 1992</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;B&gt;Date:&lt;/B&gt; 9 March 1992 &lt;BR&gt;&lt;B&gt;Location:&lt;/B&gt; Indian Ocean &lt;BR&gt;&lt;B&gt;Playable Side:&lt;/B&gt; United States &lt;BR&gt;&lt;B&gt;Duration:&lt;/B&gt; 8 hours &lt;BR&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Emboldened by the military defeat of their neighbour and enemy Iraq, the Iranian Khamenei regime has become increasingly belligerent towards the Gulf states and United States. The recent acquisition of Russian SU-24 Fencer strike aircraft with anti-ship missiles has added weight to Ayatollah Khamenei's threats to close the Straits of Hormuz to foreign shipping.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;With an air strike considered to be too risky, President Bush has authorised a cruise-missile strike to remove the threat of the Iranian SU-24s...&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
